  "title_zh": "学习新语：总书记强调“基础研究必须搞上去”",
  "title_en": "Xi Jinping Stresses That Basic Research Must Be Advanced",
  "summary_zh": "9月16日出版的《求是》杂志第18期刊发习近平总书记重要文章《在加强基础研究座谈会上的讲话》，强调基础研究必须搞上去。",
  "summary_en": "The 18th issue of Qiushi Journal, published on September 16, carried Xi Jinping's article from his speech at a symposium on strengthening basic research, stressing that basic research must be pushed forward.",
